122	// declared `required_secrets` stamped into the engine step's env. `stubText` is the
123	// vendored stub's content (the caller reads it from the mount). Returns true when
124	// the file was written (absent, or drifted from the target).
125	// What this repo's scheduler workflow SHOULD contain — the stub with its secrets
126	// stamped and its cron resolved, as text, touching no disk.
