312	const SEED_PROSE = (id) => `# ${id} — this repo's own pack
313	
314	The home for everything **specific to this repository**: the rules below, and beside them the
315	checks, skills and tasks that carry them. Nothing local needs a home invented for it — this is
316	that home. This file is loaded into every session through the rules index, so what lands *here*
